{"id": 5851, "name": "Codington County Memorial RV Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://codington.sdcounty.gov/memorial-park/", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://codington.sdcounty.gov/codington-county-community-services/", "lines": [], "via": "Codington County Community Services"}, {"url": "https://codington.sdcounty.gov/extension-service/", "lines": ["ong with the required fee. Returning 4-H members may re-enroll online. | Cloverbuds | Cloverbuds is a program for youth ages 5-7 that meet once a month after school in Waverly, Florence or Watertown. The cost to join is $20.00. This covers the cost of snacks, activities and insurance. Please stop by the Codington County Extension Office at 1910 West Kemp Avenue for new Cloverbud enrollment information. Returning Clov", "th or participate in a community service project in their community. There are many projects and activities they can be involved in, see the brochure for more information. The cost to join which covers insurance fees is $1.50 for a regular member and $2.50 for a horse member. | Youth | Opportunities are available for local youth to participate in Progressive Farm Safety Day, Kid Kare Babysitting Clinic, Youth Outreac"], "via": "Extension Service / 4-H"}, {"url": "https://codington.sdcounty.gov/veterans-service/", "lines": [], "via": "Veterans Service"}, {"url": "https://codington.sdcounty.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/6835-CampgroundBrochure25.pdf", "pdf": true, "via": "Campground Brochure & Map"}]}
{"id": 5852, "name": "Brown County Fairgrounds", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.brown.sd.us/department/fairgrounds-parks/camping", "lines": ["st portion of the fairgrounds are a number of sites with electricity and water. Just south of Centennial Village there is a smaller camping area that has 40 sites with water and electricity available. | Camping Fees are $25.00 per night for sites with water and power hook-ups. Fees are $30.00 per night for sites with water, power and sewer hook-ups. During the Brown County Fair there are no camp sites available. | Im"]}, {"url": "https://www.brown.sd.us/department/fairgrounds-parks/camping", "lines": ["st portion of the fairgrounds are a number of sites with electricity and water. Just south of Centennial Village there is a smaller camping area that has 40 sites with water and electricity available. | Camping Fees are $25.00 per night for sites with water and power hook-ups. Fees are $30.00 per night for sites with water, power and sewer hook-ups. During the Brown County Fair there are no camp sites available. | Im"], "via": "Camping"}, {"url": "https://www.brown.sd.us/department/fairgrounds-parks/richmond-lake-youth-camp", "lines": ["e Brown County Fairgrounds. Get the directions to the camp and check it out in person. Call 605-626-7116 or email sarah.hartje@browncounty.sd.gov to book this camping facility. | Rental Rates | Daily Rates | Lodge Only: $250 per day | Dorm Only: $100 per dorm (3 dormitories available and each one sleeps 36) | Infirmary Cabin: $75 per day (Sleeps 8) | Wedding Special; 3-day rental (Friday-Sunday, includes Lodge & Infi", " Lodge Only: $250 per day | Dorm Only: $100 per dorm (3 dormitories available and each one sleeps 36) | Infirmary Cabin: $75 per day (Sleeps 8) | Wedding Special; 3-day rental (Friday-Sunday, includes Lodge & Infirmary) $500 | 2-day rental (Friday-Saturday, includes Lodge & Infirmary) $400 | Group Rates | Apply to camps or events with 2-night minimum. | Group